title: "Geomorphological Hazards of Slopes — short-course materials"
abstract: >-
  Teaching materials (lecture-linked Jupyter notebooks) on slope instability
  and geohazards in steep terrain: landslides, debris flows, rock falls, and
  the soil-mechanical principles behind them. Developed for a 3-day PhD short
  course at the Centre for Polar Studies, University of Silesia, May 2026.
type: software
